  "_doc": "Sources for LoopStar's recorded kits (iPhone, subscribers). build_sample_kits.py reads this, fetches each kit's archive or files (sha256-checked), shapes one WAV per voice into sample-kits/<id>/, and rewrites sample-kits/index.json. CC0 or CC-BY ONLY: the samples are redistributed (this public repo, then the app). Per kit: id (never reused), name, group, blurb, credit (author + licence, shown in the app), license_url (where the licence was read), fallback (synth kit id that plays wherever the samples aren't), access (default subscriber), archive {url, sha256} and/or sources {voice: member-in-archive | {url, sha256, keep_start}}, gains {voice: x} (balance, default 1).",
